
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Happy Birthday, My Dearest Sister ❤️</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

    <div class="stars"></div>

    <div class="container">

        <div class="tag">A SPECIAL DAY FOR SOMEONE SPECIAL ✨</div>

        <h1>Happy Birthday</h1>
        <h2>My Dearest Sister ❤️</h2>

        <p class="intro">
            Today is all about celebrating YOU!
            The most wonderful sister anyone could ever ask for.
        </p>

        <div class="cake">
            <div class="candle">
                <div class="flame"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="icing"></div>
            <div class="cake-top"></div>
            <div class="cake-bottom"></div>
        </div>

        <p class="wish">Make a wish! 🥰</p>

        <button id="wishBtn">Celebrate My Birthday 🎉</button>

        <div class="envelope" id="envelope">
            <div class="envelope-icon">💌</div>
            <p>Open your special letter</p>
        </div>

        <div class="letter" id="letter">
            <h2>To My Beautiful Sister ❤️</h2>

            <p>
                Happy Birthday to my dearest sister!
                You are one of the biggest blessings in my life.
            </p>

            <p>
                Thank you for bringing happiness, laughter,
                and beautiful memories into our family.
                May your life always be filled with love,
                success, happiness, and endless blessings.
            </p>

            <p>
                May Allah bless you with good health,
                protect you from every difficulty,
                and grant you everything your heart wishes for.
                Ameen. 🤲
            </p>

            <h3>Love you always! ❤️</h3>

            <div class="signature">
                With lots of love,<br>
                Your Loving Sibling 💕
            </div>
        </div>

        <footer>
            Made with ❤️ especially for you
        </footer>

    </div>

    <div id="confetti-container"></div>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
